### Phase 4 — Image Upload Assessment

**Assessment:** Eco Portable Cabins are custom-configured products with significant dimensional and layout variation. However, the primary buyer requirement (size, material, application type) can be captured through spec values. Sellers do not need a visual reference to determine whether they can supply — they need dimensions and material specs, which are text-based. Image upload is not recommended for this category.

